{"parse": {"title": "成你本所是-06", "pageid": 139757, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-05\" title=\"成你本所是-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">成你本所是-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-07\" title=\"成你本所是-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">成你本所是</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9C.82.E8.9C.9C.E4.BE.9B.E5.93.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蜂蜜供品\">蜂蜜供品</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蜂蜜供品</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Honeyed Words</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>啊，这的确是我认识的那个多沃卡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>多情又无情，女巫中的女巫，神秘学家中的神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小瑞安侬无奈地挠了挠脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>作为女儿，她应当维护自己的母亲。但她知道，欧文夫人的评价是完全正确的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>之后呢？我是说，你十六岁生日前夕和多沃卡吵了架，然后赌气离家出走的那天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>不是的……我觉得那很难算得上是吵架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>毕竟妈妈只是、只是在试图安慰我而已。是我不愿意听她说话，自己跑了出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">旅店招待：</div><div>哦！所以你还是离家出走了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>我没有离家出走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>我只是想回一趟过去的家，祭拜父亲和其他人……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>变故来得总是如此猝不及防。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314619.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314619.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-314619.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314619.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>悬浮定止！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看似坚实的落叶层骤然塌陷，在神秘术的帮助下，她才免于落入坑底陷阱之口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"535003.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"535003.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9e/HeadIconSmall-535003.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-535003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格林杜尔：</div><div>咕？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>体形远远大过陷阱的尘酿鹰蹲在洞口，探头朝下看，叫声中带着丝担忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314612.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-314612.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314612.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314612.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-314612.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314612.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cf/HeadIconSmall-314612.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314612.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我没事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坑底弥漫着腐土与金属的腥气，待她检查过坑中的绳网陷阱后，冷汗顷刻浸透后背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>有动静？快去看看是不是逮着大货了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没等她继续思索下去，纷沓的脚步声和金属器械碰撞的叮当脆响，如同冰水般一齐从林外泼来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314622.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-314622.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314622.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314622.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-314622.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314622.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/HeadIconSmall-314622.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314622.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！带他们走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她连忙把趴在肩头的小鹰抓了下来，正托着它想要让它飞出陷阱时，满含恶意的声音已经离得太近了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>快！隐身！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格林杜尔早已将自己藏在了光下，但挂在自己身上的幼鸟显然尚未掌握偏光的戏法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几乎是在同时，几张粗糙而贪婪的面孔出现在坑口边缘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>嘿！是个带着小鸟的姑娘！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>这情报买得真值，幼年期的尘酿鹰……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>在黑市上不知道能换多少利齿子儿！这回总算没走空！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手急不可耐地伸向她的肩头，幼鸟被惊得绒毛炸起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小女巫的身体先意识一步做出了反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她猛地向陷阱坑另一侧蜷缩，粗糙的指尖擦着她的衣领掠过，带起一股令人作呕的贪婪气味。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>啧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼见敌人手中亮出了武器，一个大胆的想法在她脑子里浮现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>等、等等！别、别伤害他们……也别伤害我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她缓缓抬起头，让林间漏下的些许月光照亮自己沾满泥污的，刻意显得惊惶无助的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>驯鸟女巫抱紧怀中仿佛理解了她意图的幼鸟，目光怯生生地扫过坑边凶恶的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你们……是想要更大的、成年的那种巨鸟，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她吞咽了一下，仿佛在鼓起勇气说出秘密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314625.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314625.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我，我知道一个地方，有巢……不止一只。只要你们放过我和孩子们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷猎者们交换了一个狐疑的眼神，像是在打量她话语中的可信度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>你要知道，骗我们可没有好下场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314625.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314625.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>当然！我是林中猎户，我也是偶然发现的。那巢很隐蔽，在……在东边一处废墟里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314625.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314625.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-314625.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314625.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你们看！我的小鸟就是从那儿偷出来的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许是她怀中的雏鸟成了最佳的证明，一根绳子被抛进了陷阱坑里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>自己爬上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她将幼鸟放回术杖上，顺势抓住麻绳，自己一口气爬出了陷阱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重新站在昏沉的月光下，却仿佛踏入了一个更危险的囚笼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>走、走吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她指向记忆中的“东方”，声音依旧带着几丝恰到好处的怯弱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>可能有些远……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>别想耍花招。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为首的偷猎者拍了拍腰间黑沉沉的武器，威胁意味不言而喻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>当然，只要您肯大发慈悲放过我和我的鸟儿们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>如果您能为我解决巢里的大鸟，那更是再好不过了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>你带着幼鸟，却和大鸟有过节？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>没错，不瞒您说，他们是我从巢里偷出来的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"616701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"616701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/HeadIconSmall-616701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-616701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅰ：</div><div>哦？我听说尘酿鹰都是些睚眦必报的畜生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>当、当然……所以大鸟一直在骚扰我的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>这些孩子是我千辛万苦从蛋里孵出来的，无论如何我也舍不得把他们还给大鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-615420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">偷猎者Ⅱ：</div><div>哈哈！你倒是胆子大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>偷猎者们推搡着她，开始行进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳脸上挂着难看的笑，一瘸一拐地走在前面，手心冰凉。她的每一步都在编织一个危险的谎言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不时有冰冷的风吹在她的脸上，仿佛格林杜尔无声的注视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我必须这么做……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自己必须演下去，直到时机来临。或者，直到无路可走。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "成你本所是-06"}}